<title>UK: BAA sees strong June passenger figures.</title>
<headline>BAA sees strong June passenger figures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Passenger figures at British airports operator BAA Plc were strong in June, said group finance director Russell Walls on Thursday.  </p>
<p>&quot;They were strong, not too different from May although I don't think June will be quite as high as May,&quot; Walls told Reuters in an interview.</p>
<p>In May, BAA's seven UK airports handled a total of 8.9 million passengers, an increase of 8.9 percent on May 1996.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
